Let's take the potions example you cite (and you didn't even mention Strong
Poison and Paralysis). Slowing? Be sure to be in a safe area when you drink.
Confusion? Ditto. Paralysis? Ditto. Degeneration? OK, don't drink if you have
a stat at three or lower, then fire away; if you're too miserly to spare a
potion of restore ability, you can even just wait out the restoration of the
stat.

Or wands: try out every wand on something pitiful, so you don't use-ID, say,
a wand of hasting on a hydra. And you're all set.

